{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51530","headline":"梨花 · 温宪","name":"梨花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿阴寒食晚，犹自满空园。\n两歇芳菲白，蜂稀寂寞繁。\n一枝横野路，数树出江村。\n怅望频回首，何人共酒尊。\n（《古今图书集成·草木典·梨部》（见宋陈景沂《全芳备祖前集》卷九《梨花》。\n「蜂稀」，《全芳备祖》作「蜂声」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}